      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.87,
      "end_seconds": 5.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Uh, good evening, doctor, thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.53,
      "end_seconds": 11.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "no problem at all, come in what's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.07,
      "end_seconds": 18.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "I'm here because of a tight chest in the morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.92,
      "end_seconds": 23.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "how long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.38,
      "end_seconds": 27.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "I've had it for five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.2,
      "end_seconds": 32.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.22,
      "end_seconds": 34.14,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "Mostly severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.16,
      "end_seconds": 37.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.54,
      "end_seconds": 51.95,
      "duration_seconds": 13.41,
      "text": "A bit of a sore throat goes along with it, most of the time. The bit of a sore throat? That's been for three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.79,
      "end_seconds": 56.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.06,
      "end_seconds": 67.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.83,
      "end_seconds": 105.01,
      "duration_seconds": 16.18,
      "text": "Okay: height 164 centimetres, weight 63 kilos, heart rate 72, respiratory rate 15, temp 36.8 degrees, BMI works out to 23.4, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, blood pressure 118 over 81."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.95,
      "end_seconds": 110.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.46,
      "end_seconds": 115.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "stay as you are for a moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.05,
      "end_seconds": 128.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "The chest is clear and your oxygen level is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.66,
      "end_seconds": 139.55,
      "duration_seconds": 7.89,
      "text": "good, you can sit up again. A few quick ones: leg swelling, fever or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.18,
      "end_seconds": 142.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.57,
      "end_seconds": 146.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "so, any weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.37,
      "end_seconds": 151.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any weight loss"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.74,
      "end_seconds": 157.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.99,
      "end_seconds": 160.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "no, that's all normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.64,
      "end_seconds": 168.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.62,
      "end_seconds": 169.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "skin's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.64,
      "end_seconds": 184.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.89,
      "end_seconds": 189.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "I mean, no, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.35,
      "end_seconds": 207.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.74,
      "end_seconds": 211.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.75,
      "end_seconds": 225.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.12,
      "end_seconds": 230.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "No, not that that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.62,
      "end_seconds": 237.29,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.35,
      "end_seconds": 243.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.44,
      "end_seconds": 248.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.47,
      "end_seconds": 259.39,
      "duration_seconds": 9.92,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I walk the dog every morning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.69,
      "end_seconds": 276.98,
      "duration_seconds": 6.29,
      "text": "okay, thinking it through, it points towards a lingering cough after a viral infection"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.22,
      "end_seconds": 281.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.95,
      "end_seconds": 307.19,
      "duration_seconds": 24.24,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a lingering cough after a viral infection is my leading thought, not anything worse. I'll request a breathing test, it'll help with breathlessness. What I'm giving you is salbutamol inhaler, 100 micrograms, two puffs when needed, for two weeks. That's for wheeze and cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.24,
      "end_seconds": 309.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "That's simple enough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.86,
      "end_seconds": 332.94,
      "duration_seconds": 22.08,
      "text": "honey and lemon in warm water can ease it, and avoid smoky rooms if you smoke, this is a good moment to think about stopping, and we can help you with that if you cough up blood or get breathless at rest, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.91,
      "end_seconds": 336.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "I know what to watch for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.81,
      "end_seconds": 342.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Okay, is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.63,
      "end_seconds": 347.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
